# TypeScript / Next.js

- Prefer App Router server components; add `"use client"` only when needed.
- Colocate feature code under `web/src` following existing module folders.
- Money, auth, and RLS paths: no silent catch — log and rethrow or return typed errors.
- Do not hardcode property IDs, rates, or menus in UI — load from CMS/ERP/DB.
- Ops boards (KOT, POS, room status): prefer Supabase Realtime over polling.
